---
title: PDF解析 — 検査と並列処理
---
%% archmap: {"view":"activity"}
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  state "PDFを受け付ける" as receive
  state valid <<choice>>
  valid : 受付可能？
  state parallel <<fork>>
  parallel : 並列処理
  state "本文を抽出する" as extract
  state "プレビューを生成する" as preview
  state complete <<join>>
  complete : 両方完了
  state "解析結果を保存する" as save
  state "受付エラーを返す" as reject
  [*] --> receive
  receive --> valid
  valid --> parallel: はい
  valid --> reject: いいえ
  parallel --> extract
  parallel --> preview
  extract --> complete
  preview --> complete
  complete --> save
  save --> [*]
  reject --> [*]
